NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000354 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000355 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000356 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000357 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000358 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000359 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000360 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000361 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000362 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000363 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000364 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000365 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000366 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000367 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000368 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000369 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000370 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000371 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000372 ""
